# About

Hello! I'm Lautaro Acosta Quintana, a programmer from Argentina. I'm currently pursuing an Information Systems Engineering degree at [UTN](https://www.frre.utn.edu.ar/). I simply love to code.

I cant help but to [ask questions](https://jvns.ca/blog/good-questions/#be-willing-to-say-what-you-don-t-understand), so I [write about things](/posts.html) I find interesting.

You can find my résumé in [English](https://cdn.lautaroacosta.com/resume_us_3.pdf) or [Spanish](https://cdn.lautaroacosta.com/resume_es_3.pdf).
